{
  "id": "wolfsdk.gore_ultimativ",
  "name": "Ultimate Gore - Hits, Voice, Physics, Lethality",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "author": "wolfsdk",
  "description": "The four layers below gore type and blood amount. Hits on flesh use blood_medium instead of blood_small, and both blood pool and blood flow point to the placeholder 'particle/default' in the original - both are now wired up, bullet hole decals x1.6. Pain and death screams fire 4x as often (interval x0.25, playChance at least 90%). Ragdoll joint friction x0.42 so bodies fall limp instead of stiff. And aiIncomingDamageScale raised in all five difficulty levels - an enemy that soaks up ten rifle bullets is the most unrealistic thing in the whole game.",
